## Quick Start

```c++
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>
#include <unistd.h>

__AFL_FUZZ_INIT();

extern "C" int main(int argc, char **argv) {
    __AFL_INIT();
    unsigned char *buf = __AFL_FUZZ_TESTCASE_BUF;
    while (__AFL_LOOP(10000)) {
        int len = __AFL_FUZZ_TESTCASE_LEN;
        // Call your code with fuzzer-provided data
        my_function(buf, len);
    }
    return 0;
}
```

Compile and run:
```bash
afl-clang++ -fsanitize=address harness.cc target.cc -o fuzz_target
afl-fuzz -i corpus/ -o findings/ ./fuzz_target
```
